<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Dow Chemical cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Dow Chemical cut to hold.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Boston said it downgraded Dow Chemical Co to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Dow Chemical lost one to 86-3/8.</p>
</text>
